            },
            "message": "migration(forgejo): migrate reactions and reviews (#15194)\n\n- Forgejo advertises pre-release version (eg [`17.0.0-26-363f3dc30b+gitea-1.22.0`](https://code.forgejo.org/api/v1/version)).\n- Such pre-releases version never fullfix the `hashicorp/go-version.Constraints.Check` used by `gitea_sdk.Client.CheckServerVersionConstraint`.\n\nHence migration from a Forgejo host (like codeberg) would wrongly skip reactions and reviews (and use a weaker pagination)\n\nThis fixes this, by using `Version.GreaterThanOrEqual` instead.\n\nReviewed-on: https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/15194\nReviewed-by: Mathieu Fenniak <redacted@example.invalid>\n",
